!Name: reflectors
!CFast, low-period glider reflectors. These work
!Cfor any period 22 or higher that is a multiple
!Cof their period.
!C
!CPeriods 5, 6, 8: Noam Elkies, 16-Sep-1998
!CPeriod 7: Noam Elkies, 1-Aug-1999
!CPeriod 15: oscillator by Karel Suhajda, Dec-02.
!CP5 reflector later improved by David Eppstein
!Cand Noam Elkies.
!C
!CNote that there are two possible positions for the
!Cspark in the p6, p7, and p15 versions.
!
